\section{Preliminary Experiment Setup}\label{app:intro_exp}

\subsection{Data Creation}

For the polit experiment, we conduct experiments on the same datasets as mentioned in Section~\ref{sec:pilot_study}, \textit{i.e.,} VQA datasets \textbf{DocVQA}~\citep{mathew2021docvqa}, \textbf{ChartQA}~\citep{masry-etal-2022-chartqa} and KIE datasets \textbf{SROIE}~\citep{huang2019icdar2019}, \textbf{FUNSD}~\citep{jaume2019funsd}. Since these datasets are multimodal but the pilot study focuses on LLM-based reasoning, we structure the input using the OCR text and bounding box provided by respective dataset. For example: ``Given document <document>Saint[466,77,554,107]\textbackslash nLouis[561,77,657,107]\textbackslash nHeart[664,77,760,106] ...''. However, these datasets do not include reasoning steps. To address this, we employ DeepSeek-R1 to generate plausible reasoning processes by providing the question and final answer. The statistics is shown in Table~\ref{tab:data_statis}.


