The primary design goal of FAIRBridge is to empower researchers to interact with the vast and complex landscape of biological data using intuitive natural language queries. The system is designed to be powerful and user-friendly, automating complex data retrieval tasks while providing transparency and control to the user. Key contributions include:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Autonomous Database Discovery:} FAIRBridge intelligently identifies potentially relevant databases from scientific literature and other sources.
    \item \textbf{Automated access protocol generation:} The system automatically determines how to access and query each database, handling diverse interfaces and formats.
