% the set of vertices is included in the set $2^{Q_\aut} \times 2^{Q_\aut \to
% 2^{Q_\autb}} = 2^{Q_\aut} \times 2^{(2^{Q_\autb})^{Q_\aut}}$.
% % We can view $f_i$ as a mapping of the form $f_i\colon Q_\aut \to 2^{Q_\autb}$.
% This allows us to bound the number of vertices in the graph by the following expression:
