%   =
%   2^{|Q_\aut| + 2^{|Q_\aut|\cdot|Q_\autb|}}.
% \end{equation}
% %
% The graph construction involves solving SMT formulae. In the general case, we need to handle sub-formulae of the form $t_1 = r \cdot t_2$ (or equivalently $t_2 = r \cdot t_1$), which require solving non-linear constraints from the \texttt{NIRA} category.
