This section presents the numerical results regarding the performance metrics of the proposed system. 
The derived analytical expressions are validated through Monte Carlo simulations, which are implemented in Python\footnote {The code is available at: \url{https://github.com/HigoTh/PLC_VLC}}. 
The presented analytical curves closely align with the simulation results, validating the derived expressions. 
