The expectation of the KL divergence between $q(\hat{\mathbf{s}}_1,\hat{\mathbf{s}}_2,\tilde{\mathbf{z}}_1,\tilde{\mathbf{z}}_2|\mathbf{x}_1,\mathbf{x}_2)$ and  $p(\hat{\mathbf{s}}_1,\hat{\mathbf{s}}_2,\tilde{\mathbf{z}}_1,\tilde{\mathbf{z}}_2|\mathbf{x}_1,\mathbf{x}_2)$ over the data distribution $p_{\mathbf{x}_1,\mathbf{x}_2}$ is given by \eqref{kl}, where $\text{const}''$ denotes a constant.
\end{proposition}

