	Regular transitions concern synchronizations between actions that occur at top-level in different parallel components. 
	If $\SPExptoHCP{P}$ has a regular transition, then $P\in\SPExp$  has a reduction.



    \begin{lemma}\label{lemma: shape of processes in HCP with regular reductions}
		Suppose $P\in$ $\HCP$. If $T:P\TransitionHCP{\tau}Q$ s.t. $\RegularReduction{T}$, then either:
		\begin{enumerate}
