\end{enumerate}
Since $\news{x}{y}(Q\para R)\equiv\news{x}{y}(Q)\para R$, it is clear that $\news{x}{y}(Q\para R)\ReductionSimulation\news{x}{y}(Q)\para R$. It remains to check that if $\news{x}{y}(Q\para R)\LabelledReduction{a}{b} S$ and $\news{x}{y}(Q)\para R \LabelledReduction{a}{b} S'$, then $(S,S')\in\mathbb{S}$. We proceed as follows:
In Case (1) we have:\\
