\paragraph{Human Correlation}
Table \ref{tab:results_metric_eval} shows the human correlation results in the \textbf{Full} scenario.\footnote{Results for the \textbf{Cited} scenario can be found in Appendix \ref{appendix:results_metric_eval_cited_only}. Details of the two scenarios are provided in Section \ref{subsec:principle_fine_grained}.}
