\textsc{CiteEval-Auto} based on GPT-4o substantially outperforms state-of-the-art citation evaluators, at both the statement- and response-level.\footnote{We also experimented with other LLM backbones such as GPT-4-turbo and GPT-4o performs the best. Details are provided in Appendix \ref{sec:results_llms_for_citeeval}.}
