To prove the relationship given by \eqref{8}, we take the first term $f_{\mathrm{e}1}\max\{N_\mathrm{e},M_1\}$ as an example and other terms can be derived in similar ways.
The linear equations given by \eqref{6a} when $i=1$ can be rewritten as
\begin{align}
