The Fixed-Length Predictor constructs the single-step predictor bank from a single ARX model repeated and staggered in time \cite{dong2008CLSPC, dinkla2024closed} and is equivalent to the certainty-equivalent portion of the method in \cite{chiuso2025harnessing} which, in addition, derives a separation principle for DDPC and an optimal input regularization.
