For the sake of having $\dot{\xi}$ and $\dot{\zeta}$, we derive $\dot{q} - [\dot x;~0_{l-\nu}]$ by $\dot q$ in (\ref{ss-q}) and $\dot x$ in (\ref{Real plant}) as

