Therefore, the overall closed-loop dynamics partitioned with $\xi$, $\zeta$ and $e$ is represented as
\begin{subequations} \label{noisy-semi-singular}
\begin{align}
    \tau \dot{\xi} & = A_l \xi -a_0T_1\hat{\mathbf e}_l \xi_1 -\hat{\mathbf e}_\nu (g{\mathbf d}-g\hat{d} -\bar g D v) \label{xi-dyna1} \\
     & \quad\, +\frac{a_0}{\tau^\nu} T_1\hat{\mathbf e}_l v - \tau \hat{\mathbf e}_{\nu+1} \hat{\mathbf e}_\nu^\top \dot \Xi^\ast_\xi, \nonumber \\
